---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Payment Guide — How to Pay in China';
const description = 'Step-by-step guides for foreigners to set up Alipay, WeChat Pay, and use credit cards in China.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        Payment Guide
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500">
        How to pay in China as a foreigner — Alipay, WeChat Pay, credit cards, and cash. Updated June 2026.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Article 1 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/payment-guide/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">GUIDE</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">5 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            How to Pay in China: Complete Guide for Foreign Visitors
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Alipay, WeChat Pay, cash, or credit cards — which one should you use? A quick overview of all payment options in China.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 2 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">TUTORIAL</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">8 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            How to Set Up Alipay as a Foreigner (2026)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Step-by-step Alipay setup guide for tourists. Download, register with an international number, verify your identity, and link your foreign credit card.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 3 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">TUTORIAL</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">8 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            How to Set Up WeChat Pay as a Foreigner (2026)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            WeChat Pay setup walkthrough — download WeChat, bind your international card, verify your identity, and start paying with QR codes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 4 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/foreign-cards/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">REFERENCE</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">5 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            Can You Use Foreign Credit Cards in China? A Realistic Look
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Where Visa and Mastercard actually work in China, ATM withdrawal costs, and why mobile payments are the way to go.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 5 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/tipping/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">CULTURE</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">3 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            China Tipping Culture: Do You Need to Tip?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            No, tipping is not expected in China. A quick guide on what to do (and what not to do) when it comes to tipping.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 6 -->
      <a href="/en/payment/payment-fails/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">TROUBLESHOOT</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">4 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">
            What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Common payment failure reasons and step-by-step troubleshooting. What to check first when your QR code payment won't go through.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-brand-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Quick Answer</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Set up Alipay before you fly. Link your Visa or Mastercard to it — that covers 95% of payments in China. Add WeChat Pay as a backup, keep some cash (¥500–1000) for emergencies, and you're good.
      </p>
      <a href="/en/payment/payment-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
        Start with the payment guide →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-8 text-center">Last updated: June 11, 2026</p>
</Layout>
